# --- Storage ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Required on Vercel. Without it the two halves of a retried booking can land on
# different serverless instances and the defect becomes invisible.
# Add "Upstash for Redis" from the Vercel Marketplace, or reuse the console's.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# --- Sandbox admin -------------------------------------------------------------
# Guards POST /api/sandbox/reset, which wipes every reservation. Leave empty for
# local dev; SET IT on any public deployment or a passer-by can reset your demo.
# Generate: openssl rand -hex 16
SANDBOX_ADMIN=
